unic-learning-loop

This plugin is a port of `continual-learning` from https://github.com/cursor/plugins
at commit ac93d26be3c3 (ac93d26be3c3f0db4c4c88c7dac4bdf7deab2b2a).

scripts/cadence-gate.mjs is a Node rewrite of
continual-learning/hooks/continual-learning-stop.ts at that commit.

skills/learn/SKILL.md is adapted from
continual-learning/skills/continual-learning/SKILL.md, and
agents/learned-rules-drafter.md from
continual-learning/agents/agents-memory-updater.md, at that commit.

